│  # Madrid: A Cultural Odyssey for Art, History, and Culinary Delights (January           │
│  25–February 4, 2026)                                                                    │
│                                                                                          │
│  ## 📅 7-Day Itinerary with Weather & Logistics                                          │
│                                                                                          │
│  ### **Day 1: Arrival & Royal Palace (1/25)**                                            │
│  - **Weather**: 12°C (day), 6°C (night), light rain.                                     │
│  - **Morning**: Arrive at **Adolfo Suárez Madrid–Barajas Airport** (10:00 AM). Transfer  │
│  to **Hotel Ritz Madrid** (€280/night, 5-star, central location).                        │
│  - **Afternoon**: Explore **Royal Palace of Madrid** (€18 entry). Highlight: Hall of     │
│  Realms, Throne Room.                                                                    │
│  - **Dinner**: *Cervecería El Jardín* (tapas crawl: *tortilla española*, *pimientos de   │
│  Padrón*).                                                                               │
│  - **Evening**: Stroll **Plaza Mayor**, enjoy *café con leche* at **Café Gijón**.        │
│                                                                                          │
│  ### **Day 2: Prado & Reina Sofía Museums (1/26)**                                       │
│  - **Weather**: 11°C (day), 7°C (night).                                                 │
│  - **Morning**: **Museo del Prado** (€18 entry). Must-see: *Las Meninas*, *The Opening   │
│  of the Fifth Seal*.                                                                     │
│  - **Afternoon**: **Reina Sofía Museum** (€10 entry). Highlight: Picasso’s *Guernica*.   │
│  - **Lunch**: *Mercado de San Miguel* (try *Pintxos* at **Casa de la Infanta**).         │
│  - **Evening**: **Museo Sorolla** (private collection of modernist art).                 │
